{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/thm-unit-root-iff-integrable","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Theorem","doco:Section"],"label":"thm:unit-root-iff-integrable","kind":"theorem","title":"Unit-root iff integrable","uses":["papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/def-commutative-formal-group","papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/def-skewed-poisson-structure","papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/def-unit-root-f-crystal","papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/def-non-commutative-formal-group","papers/fred2005-formal-groups/blocks/thm-skew-poisson-integrates"],"cites":["references/fred2005"],"tags":["f-crystal","unit-root","integrability","equivalence"],"leanRef":"fred2005:Fred2005.unit_root_iff_integrable","text":"unit-root-iff-integrable.md","leanSource":"folio/fred2005-formal-groups/formal-groups-chapter/unit-root-iff-integrable.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"thm:unit-root-iff-integrable\"></a><p>The <a href=\"#def:unit-root-f-crystal\">unit-root condition</a> on the F-crystal\nassociated to a <a href=\"#def:commutative-formal-group\">commutative formal group</a>\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H</code> is equivalent to integrability of the\n<a href=\"#def:skewed-poisson-structure\">skewed-Poisson structure</a>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\exists\\;\\text{unit-root F-crystal on } H\n  \\;\\iff\\;\n  \\exists\\;G / \\mathbb{Z}_p \\text{ with } G \\bmod p \\cong H.</code></pre>\n<p>The forward direction uses the\n<a href=\"#thm:skew-poisson-integrates\">integration theorem</a> to construct <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G</code>\nfrom the skewed-Poisson datum.  The backward direction produces a\nunit-root F-crystal via the identity Frobenius endomorphism.</p>\n<p>Reference: <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"fred2005\">[fred2005]</span>, Corollary 5.3.</p>\n","source":"folio/fred2005-formal-groups/formal-groups-chapter/unit-root-iff-integrable.md","heading":"Theorem","number":"1.7.2"}
